{"signature": "1247240af92040debf31550c9e2351f98df6e8fab2fb3aa90f172e90567b42e9", "result": {"checks": {"check": {"scope": {"id": "check", "service": "slack", "file": "messages/C0880U9751A/2025-0[89].json", "pointer": "", "field": "user", "values": ["EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID"]}, "matches": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-08.json", "pointer": "/266", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "50fca3a7102f07ff25eef5a8ebc9f674", "ts": "1755031151.440159", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID> I made the PR for the VariantC branch. We're waiting to test whenever you're ready for us :[USERNAME_26053]:", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-08.json", "pointer": "/267", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "703f61bd7979653a91f6ed84e0d433ef", "ts": "1755031291.329209", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID> <@EMPLOYEE_0003_SLACK_ID> Guys, [PERSON_NAME_0022]'s latest commit to my branch and to the main removed VariantC from A/B test lists. Should I just remove my pull request or?", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1755031291.329209", "reply_count": 1, "reply_users_count": 1, "latest_reply": "1755031719.656039", "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-08.json", "pointer": "/434", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "3db9114432a0b159652274c1bab3fa9a", "ts": "1756486292.865929", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "<https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vwujscZTr_uahqBKffkiFTnecYq2CtdAQdptnEyGxik/edit?tab=t.0>\n\n<@EMPLOYEE_0006_SLACK_ID> [PERSON_NAME_0092] said he explained more in the channel. If you still have questions, let us know", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/3", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "34922c10225fe7574d528d23bba8ddd8", "ts": "1756832002.751049", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Level 5 and 33 fix\n\n`47c56c761d650cb9a2b3fc26aaf8127a57fdb38c`\n\nLevel 20-40 nuke balance\n\n`4fc3a60110823cf86b40339847dfb0e94b6b4ce7`\n\n<@EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID> <@EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID>", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/27", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "30a4f0fdc9527785393995052f7823b3", "ts": "1757008572.993629", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0032_SLACK_ID> Tomorrow morning, when you get a chance, can you please write a few scripts that checks if any levels have remaining boss buster items, or zombie types that aren't varC tagged?", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1757008572.993629", "reply_count": 13, "reply_users_count": 3, "latest_reply": "1757062878.243419", "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/31", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "7beb91065a05a2342163ad9a659025cc", "ts": "1757009163.675589", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "No I don't dare :smile:", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1757008572.993629", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/36", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "50f159fdbd6a9d02ce25d5a331fc730f", "ts": "1757009292.900589", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1757008572.993629", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": [{"blocks": [{"alt_text": "a man in a suit says oh thank god for that", "block_id": "945e7ee3-85ef-44cd-8de0-08a5ad68dad5", "fallback": "220x220px image", "image_bytes": 293084, "image_height": 220, "image_url": "https://media.tenor.com/y4YpFIIyMywAAAAM/simon-pegg-shaun-of-the-dead.gif", "image_width": 220, "is_animated": true, "title": {"emoji": true, "text": "GIF", "type": "plain_text"}, "type": "image"}], "fallback": "shared a GIF", "id": 1}]}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/38", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "fed1c6e65960c840b45b93ffa245cfb0", "ts": "1757011652.972019", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "No, if yours are working for sure we can just use these", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1757008572.993629", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/58", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "9e6a2dab0f336ea311957364fcab8361", "ts": "1757062878.243419", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "It's all good, [PERSON_NAME_0120]. Thank you very much :[USERNAME_26053]:", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1757008572.993629", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "heart", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/62", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "46ffacd936b5e17ad3f628c3ac1e967a", "ts": "1757116105.723839", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID> Can you merge my level design PR, please?", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/63", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "45a67fa474a1afddfba2f9f77de0cabf", "ts": "1757116123.686889", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "thinking_face", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": [{"blocks": [{"alt_text": "a gray cat is sitting on its hind legs and looking up", "block_id": "82e2dc89-ccca-4f8c-ba85-a95e791f3c1c", "fallback": "220x166px image", "image_bytes": 30306, "image_height": 166, "image_url": "https://media.tenor.com/YC-ygwkLDOUAAAAM/cat-cute.gif", "image_width": 220, "is_animated": true, "title": {"emoji": true, "text": "GIF", "type": "plain_text"}, "type": "image"}], "fallback": "shared a GIF", "id": 1}]}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/161", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "88b159491a5bb0e69871bc890b1b2957", "ts": "1757957142.571079", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID> Can I Push a level directly to main? It's a level4 update :[USERNAME_26053]:", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1757957142.571079", "reply_count": 2, "reply_users_count": 1, "latest_reply": "1757960012.551079", "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1::skin-tone-6", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/162", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "e150eb030d064ef47f17cfa37df9db5f", "ts": "1757960002.924599", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I made a PR :[USERNAME_26053]:", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1757957142.571079", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1::skin-tone-6", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/163", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "7533b9d9485a2806cc2604e5c3a47dcf", "ts": "1757960012.551079", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "`[PERSON_NAME_0019]/[USERNAME_24414]`", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1757957142.571079", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/354", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "fa816cf085e2bca93dd57c60e0e5bd70", "ts": "1758218113.761459", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Yeah I did a second difficulty reduction for the level", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1758216361.448149", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/355", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "c72551dec63e94b1abdddf12a2737457", "ts": "1758218118.576619", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "It's live", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1758216361.448149", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/356", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "366b2cdd6d1f6ef892ac3c12b90368ac", "ts": "1758218145.027389", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Yeah sure, I'll send a version for it in the sep30 branch", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1758215775.137159", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/414", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "34ccef423a6b14a219bcfe3a60f1db52", "ts": "1758825042.029059", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID> I made the level PR on the same branch. Feel free to merge whenever you want for the submission. :saluting_face:", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID"]}, {"count": 1, "name": "+1::skin-tone-6", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/420", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "869fa65e0de361dce081d4eb332a7e3c", "ts": "1758905803.504279", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID> <@EMPLOYEE_0032_SLACK_ID> Hey, guys. I have a small update about the levels. So, I know I committed to not using too many zombies on the screen or not too many zombies of the same kind. But after level 200+ I have to increase the item count so I need more meat. Which inevitably means more zombies. Furthermore, since we're trying to Push the game to a zombie focused gameplay, I need to create scenerios where a zombies speed makes them take the lead in the horde and screws everything over if you don't freeze or use AoE effects correctly. I'm still trying to be minimal about this but I can't keep up with it forever especially in levels 300+. I know you're trying to fix it and There is no immediate fix for the zombie memory thing just yet, but I needed to give you the heads up. There is a limit to which I can design around this issue we have and I'm at the limit basically.", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/430", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "f9bb161d2a7caee22e59dc21f8db666a", "ts": "1758915229.664119", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I still need a few monsters to see a meaningful splash", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1758906955.330199", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/431", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "916a65ff5194ce6e0dabdc6de6f3dfbe", "ts": "1758916738.235669", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "No engineering work needed initially, we can just copy paste monsters and give them more HP", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1758906988.241999", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/432", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "2cb97869d35557d398bb0631b0ad539c", "ts": "1758916770.218659", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Engineering work will be required when they grow algorythmically. But initially we can start with what we have", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1758906988.241999", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/440", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "7a9fe614494b8e2f6dfd89b36c666fe2", "ts": "1758918861.648089", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Okay, I'll pick some", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1758917744.675749", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}], "records_checked": 908, "files_selected": 2, "files_completed": 2, "scan_complete": true, "errors": []}}, "files_read_this_call": 2, "sources": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-08.json", "manifest_sha256": "dda242130474f94af3946edbacb721aa4bf4a68d4a0ebde3ba98cc63e931f2bf", "freshness": "853627f719fac376102a06aeddeeee6dce972b3713712ed7f04e1a5c1046abc1"}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "manifest_sha256": "bffceca98019ce256ba387239ec4c2bb535d1f9bc32200dfed552e3d107aef16", "freshness": "76c20e8a1b0c648b15a5df75d7977160d48d53da1fea27b726402562b7f38d7a"}], "scan_complete": true, "persona_filtered": false, "backend": "grouped-record-scan", "scope_note": "Exact direct fields in selected arrays. No SQL is applied. Absence/uniqueness is supported only within complete declared scopes. Manifest hashes are declared provenance, not fresh full-content hashes.", "checks_reused": ["zdesign"]}, "checksum": "2524bdb5ff2b5bfd6aeddd4c84c0fbf76ab63fb0daf635047c5c819c56f16da3"}